  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Monitoring and Evaluation-Public Financial Management  Programme is a component of Support to the Rwanda Public Financial Management Sector Strategic Plan (2013-2018) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xA3;295,702. It works in the following sector(s): Public finance management (PFM), Domestic revenue mobilisation, Public sector policy and administrative management, Decentralisation and support to subnational government.</narrative>
  </description>
